    "type": "game",
    "name": "SCALE BULLET \uff5eAfter Story\uff5e",
    "steam_appid": 3724470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0<strong>First, please download the trial version to check if you can play the game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0<strong>\u00a0If you play for a long time, unintended sound effects will play. Please take a break and restart the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Changes from the trial version Your level will no longer decrease when you change weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the boat and defeat enemies with your shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your HP decreases when you are hit by enemies or bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your HP reaches zero, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1 Green Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting them fills the green bar on the screen. When it\u2019s full, you receive a skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Blue Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting them draws all &quot;\u25a1 Green&quot; items on the screen toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining skills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can obtain special weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or change existing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different combinations and enjoy experimenting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys or Numpad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S Key: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W Key: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D Key: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Key: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q Key: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F1 Key: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick/D-pad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Button: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B Button: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1 Button: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L1 Button: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Button: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select Button: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Strategy tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up even if you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you use bombs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you might be able to fight on with determination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After going out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atry finally returns home after a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as she's about to head out again,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her mother calls out and stops her.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0<strong>First, please download the trial version to check if you can play the game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0<strong>\u00a0If you play for a long time, unintended sound effects will play. Please take a break and restart the game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Changes from the trial version Your level will no longer decrease when you change weapons.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Game System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the boat and defeat enemies with your shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your HP decreases when you are hit by enemies or bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your HP reaches zero, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a1 Green Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting them fills the green bar on the screen. When it\u2019s full, you receive a skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Blue Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting them draws all &quot;\u25a1 Green&quot; items on the screen toward you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By combining skills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can obtain special weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or change existing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different combinations and enjoy experimenting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys or Numpad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S Key: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W Key: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >D Key: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Key: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q Key: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F1 Key: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamepad Controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick/D-pad: Move your character and navigate the cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Button: Hold to charge, confirm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B Button: Weapon attack, cancel, skip dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >R1 Button: Use bomb</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L1 Button: Slow movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start Button: Pause/unpause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select Button: Options (key config, language settings)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Strategy tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't give up even if you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you use bombs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you might be able to fight on with determination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After going out,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atry finally returns home after a long time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as she's about to head out again,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >her mother calls out and stops her.</p>",
    "short_description": "A Roguelite action shooter where you dodge bullets, attack enemies, and power up with skills and items. While the map stays the same, different skill combos and item drops change your strategy each time. Keep challenging and master your own style!",
